The SLC601 is a smart relay module that allows you to turn the power on and off remotely as well as set on/off schedules from the mobile app.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2 compliant
- Upgrades existing lighting to a remote control lighting system
- Easy installation by inserting the Power Relay into the existing power line
- Extra control cables available to integrate with existing physical switch
- Compact 55.3 x 39 x 17.7mm module, CE certified
